# VybeKiit mobile patterns

Actionable checklist for coding in this template. **SSOT:** `AGENTS.md`. Deep detail:
`.vybekiit/platform-skills/*.md`.

## Contract (every task)

- **Decide + Guide** — you choose all tech; builder gets plain one-step instructions only.
- Pick skills via `.vybekiit/agent/goal-index.md` → `.vybekiit/skills/`.
- **Verify-before-advance** after every step. Translate errors; never paste build logs at builder.
- Never read `.env` values aloud or paste secrets in chat — keys from `.env.example` only.

## Backend-first (no device secrets)

- Phone apps **cannot safely keep private keys**. Sign-in, data, payments live on the **web backend**.
- Only setting: `EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_URL` in `.env`, resolved once in `src/lib/config.ts`.
- Every backend call goes through `src/lib/fetch-json.ts` — no hand-rolled `fetch` in screens.
- If backend lacks a feature, run the matching **web** skill first, then wire mobile screens.

## Code hygiene

1. **Check before create** — read `src/lib/README.md` before new helpers.
2. **One home per concern** — auth → `auth-client.ts`, billing → `billing-client.ts`, logging → `logger.ts`.
3. **Kit logger** — `import { log } from '@/lib/logger'`; no `console.log` in app code.
4. **KISS** — no duplicate validation; backend validates on the server.
5. **SSOT** — backend URL in `config.ts` only; plans in `plans.ts`.

Read: `code-hygiene-vybekiit.md`, `env-secrets-vybekiit.md`.

## UI (mobile)

- Build only with `src/components/ui/*` and `@vybekiit/tokens` via `useTheme()`.
- Web block libraries are **visual reference** — reimplement with kit primitives.
- See `.vybekiit/agent/ui-sources.mobile.md`. Locked sizes: `sm | default | lg | icon`.
- Layout: logical flex + system RTL; never hard-code `left`/`right` — use `start`/`end`.
- **i18n:** all user-facing strings in `messages/en.json`; use `useTranslations()` / `t()` — never inline copy. Read `i18n-vybekiit.md`.

Read: `ui-consistency-vybekiit.md`.

## React Native & Expo

- Kit hooks: `useAsync`, `useUser`, `useToast`, `FormField` — see `src/hooks/README.md`.
- Keep functions ~5 lines, props ~5; split rather than grow.
- Expo conventions per pinned skills in `.agents/skills/`.

Read: `react-patterns-vybekiit.md`, Expo skills in `.agents/skills/`.

## Quality loop

- Add/update tests with every feature; `pnpm test` green before saying done.
- After substantive edits: `pnpm format && pnpm lint`.
- Store publish has unavoidable waits — set expectations, don't fake them.

Read: `testing-vybekiit.md`, `format-lint-vybekiit.md`.

## Wire-up markers

Unfinished stubs use `TODO(vybekiit): … — skill: <name>`. When builder says "finish setup":

```bash
grep -rn "TODO(vybekiit)" .
```

Central stubs: `src/lib/auth-client.ts`, `src/lib/billing-client.ts`, `app.json`, `launch.config.ts`.
Never show markers to the builder.

## Observability

- `createLogger` via `src/lib/logger.ts`; optional Sentry via `track-errors` skill.
- Read: `observability-vybekiit.md`, `sentry-vybekiit.md`.
